# Ecosystem report runs. The Markdown is the publishable artifact and is meant
# to be committed when a snapshot is worth keeping; the JSON alongside it names
# every server probed, which is a deliberately different thing to publish.
reports/*.json
# Probe checkpoints: a live run's scratch file, not a publication.
reports/.ecosystem-*.progress.jsonl
